'''Alolan Exeggutor''' (Japanese: '''アローラナッシー''' ''Alolan Nassy'') is a {{ct|Grass}} Stage 1 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Celestial Guardians}} expansion.

