==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card features the [[Alolan form]] of {{p|Exeggutor}}.
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Team Up|Alolan Exeggutor|114}} from the {{TCG|Team Up}} expansion.
*This card's {{TCGP|Promo-A}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Forbidden Light|Alolan Exeggutor|2}} from the {{TCG|Forbidden Light}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

